----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Function Scan on pg_catalog.generate_series i
   Output: ('1'::text IS JSON), (('1'::text || (i)::text) IS JSON SCALAR), (NOT ('[]'::text IS JSON ARRAY)), ('{}'::text IS JSON OBJECT WITH UNIQUE KEYS)
   Function Call: generate_series(1, 3)
